{"id":"mochi_donut-95q","title":"add_attachment: sanitize filename stem to Mochi's [0-9a-zA-Z]{4,16} contract","description":"add_attachment defaults filename to the file's basename, but Mochi validates the attachment filename stem against [0-9a-zA-Z]{4,16} and returns an opaque 422 otherwise. rpc-flow.png fails; rpcflow.png works. Strip non-alphanumerics from the stem and clamp to 16 chars before POST /cards/:id/attachments/:file-name (multipart, field name 'file').","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"bug","owner":"joshua.oliphant@hey.com","created_at":"2026-07-22T04:27:53Z","created_by":"Joshua Oliphant","updated_at":"2026-07-22T04:32:54Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T04:32:54Z","close_reason":"Fixed in fix/attachment-filename-sanitization: stem sanitized to [0-9a-zA-Z]{4,16}; main() raises without MOCHI_API_KEY","dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
